    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wishlist Now to Stay Updated!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631350/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.poster.avif?t=1755375527\" width=736 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631350/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.webm?t=1755375527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631350/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.mp4?t=1755375527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201cIf this book was from other than God, they would have been able to find many contradictions in it\u201d (Quran 4:92)</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to <i>Divine Intervention</i>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An <strong>immersive, educational simulation</strong> that blends <strong>adventure, exploration, and discovery.</strong> <strong>Travel through the vastness of space and across the Earth as you trace the revelations of the Quran, verified by historical and scientific insights.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631350/extras/bfed5af2cc532be46c8600079b5a96e3.poster.avif?t=1755375527\" width=608 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631350/extras/bfed5af2cc532be46c8600079b5a96e3.webm?t=1755375527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631350/extras/bfed5af2cc532be46c8600079b5a96e3.mp4?t=1755375527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Verify the Claims Made in the Holy Quran</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Revealed 1400 years ago to Prophet Muhammad (\ufdfa), a man who could neither read nor write, in the deserts of Arabia, the Quran makes bold and fascinating claims that still resonate today.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the expansion of the universe to internal sea waves, this interactive journey invites you to explore 30+ of these claims, along with broader Islamic knowledge, as you examine their historical and scientific consistency - backed by evidence - and how they align with modern discoveries across fields like:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cosmology, </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hydrology,</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Egyptology,</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>History,</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Embryology</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meteorology,</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>...And beyond!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While we understand some interpretations of miracles may be exaggerated or taken beyond their intended meaning, this experience focuses on <strong>the most compelling scientific and historical truths embedded within its verses.</strong> Through an engaging format, you'll get to analyze and reflect on these profound insights bridging ancient revelation with modern science in a way never before experienced.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631350/extras/6fc830c7d9668b31b93fcc7389be490c.poster.avif?t=1755375527\" width=608 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631350/extras/6fc830c7d9668b31b93fcc7389be490c.webm?t=1755375527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631350/extras/6fc830c7d9668b31b93fcc7389be490c.mp4?t=1755375527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sand-surf in a Thrilling Journey with a Deeper Purpose</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Glide and surf golden sand dunes, soar through breathtaking landscapes, and experience the awe of vast deserts. But don\u2019t let the adventure distract you from the knowledge this game carries -\u00a0<strong>this is an invitation to learn, ponder, and connect with divine knowledge</strong> in a way that is both enlightening and entertaining, and is an educative experience at its core.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631350/extras/16316206f282069c12ab65729eea42ff.poster.avif?t=1755375527\" width=608 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631350/extras/16316206f282069c12ab65729eea42ff.webm?t=1755375527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631350/extras/16316206f282069c12ab65729eea42ff.mp4?t=1755375527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631350/extras/a8b7d866f2886367cc9ef82fc43ead60.poster.avif?t=1755375527\" width=608 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631350/extras/a8b7d866f2886367cc9ef82fc43ead60.webm?t=1755375527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631350/extras/a8b7d866f2886367cc9ef82fc43ead60.mp4?t=1755375527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Join the Experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re building Divine Intervention with care and passion, so please feel free to reach out on Discord if you have any feedback or suggestions\u00a0to help shape it into its best form!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wishlist Now to Stay Updated!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631350/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.poster.avif?t=1755375527\" width=736 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631350/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.webm?t=1755375527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631350/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.mp4?t=1755375527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201cIf this book was from other than God, they would have been able to find many contradictions in it\u201d (Quran 4:92)</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to <i>Divine Intervention</i>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An <strong>immersive, educational simulation</strong> that blends <strong>adventure, exploration, and discovery.</strong> <strong>Travel through the vastness of space and across the Earth as you trace the revelations of the Quran, verified by historical and scientific insights.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631350/extras/bfed5af2cc532be46c8600079b5a96e3.poster.avif?t=1755375527\" width=608 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631350/extras/bfed5af2cc532be46c8600079b5a96e3.webm?t=1755375527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631350/extras/bfed5af2cc532be46c8600079b5a96e3.mp4?t=1755375527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Verify the Claims Made in the Holy Quran</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Revealed 1400 years ago to Prophet Muhammad (\ufdfa), a man who could neither read nor write, in the deserts of Arabia, the Quran makes bold and fascinating claims that still resonate today.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the expansion of the universe to internal sea waves, this interactive journey invites you to explore 30+ of these claims, along with broader Islamic knowledge, as you examine their historical and scientific consistency - backed by evidence - and how they align with modern discoveries across fields like:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cosmology, </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hydrology,</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Egyptology,</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>History,</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Embryology</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meteorology,</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>...And beyond!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While we understand some interpretations of miracles may be exaggerated or taken beyond their intended meaning, this experience focuses on <strong>the most compelling scientific and historical truths embedded within its verses.</strong> Through an engaging format, you'll get to analyze and reflect on these profound insights bridging ancient revelation with modern science in a way never before experienced.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631350/extras/6fc830c7d9668b31b93fcc7389be490c.poster.avif?t=1755375527\" width=608 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631350/extras/6fc830c7d9668b31b93fcc7389be490c.webm?t=1755375527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631350/extras/6fc830c7d9668b31b93fcc7389be490c.mp4?t=1755375527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sand-surf in a Thrilling Journey with a Deeper Purpose</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Glide and surf golden sand dunes, soar through breathtaking landscapes, and experience the awe of vast deserts. But don\u2019t let the adventure distract you from the knowledge this game carries -\u00a0<strong>this is an invitation to learn, ponder, and connect with divine knowledge</strong> in a way that is both enlightening and entertaining, and is an educative experience at its core.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631350/extras/16316206f282069c12ab65729eea42ff.poster.avif?t=1755375527\" width=608 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631350/extras/16316206f282069c12ab65729eea42ff.webm?t=1755375527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631350/extras/16316206f282069c12ab65729eea42ff.mp4?t=1755375527\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631350/extras/a8b7d866f2886367cc9ef82fc43ead60.poster.avif?t=1755375527\" width=608 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631350/extras/a8b7d866f2886367cc9ef82fc43ead60.webm?t=1755375527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.